  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Visalia, Sacred Tiki Tattoo is a sanctuary for minimalist ink enthusiasts seeking simple yet profound designs. Operating in a serene and meticulously crafted environment, the studio offers a unique and personal tattooing experience with their skilled artists, available from Tuesday to Thursday, 11am-7pm, and Friday to Saturday, 11am-8pm. Whether you seek delicate lines or understated elegance, Sacred Tiki Tattoo is your destination for tattoos that speak softly and resonate deeply.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Visalia, California, United States\n\nWALKINS WELCOME \nCASH ONLY\n11am-7pm Tuesday-Saturday \n(559)741-9070\nWE DON’T PIERCE\n@steveeasley \n@tommygtattoos5",
